# Build context here is ./frontend (see docker-compose.yml). Without this,
# `COPY . .` in frontend/Dockerfile would overwrite the image's freshly
# `npm install`-ed node_modules with whatever is on the host (often built for
# a different OS/arch), and every build would re-tar it to the daemon.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/

**/npm-debug.log*

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store
